.TH ITCMDR\-PLUGIN\-PS 1 "" "itcmdr" "itcmdr manual"
.SH NAME
itcmdr\-plugin\-ps \- host for PowerShell check plugins
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
itcmdr\-plugin\-ps \-\-script MAIN.ps1
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Runs a PowerShell plugin's main script for the agent and speaks the plugin protocol on stdio. Started by \fBitcmdr-agent\fR(1); see the plugins guide.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B ITCMDR_POWERSHELL
PowerShell to run (default powershell.exe on Windows, pwsh elsewhere)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_PLUGIN_SCRIPT
the plugin script, instead of \-\-script
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBitcmdr\fR(7), docs/README.md (also the in-app help: \fBitcmdr-cli help\fR, \fBitcmdr-admin help\fR)
